      "id": "unread-after-peek-and-grow",
      "text": "Start with 'éx' in a buffer with spare capacity. ReadRune consumes the two UTF-8 bytes for 'é'. Peek(2) returns the one unread byte 'x' and io.EOF without advancing or clearing the recorded rune read. Grow(0) also leaves that record in place while 'x' is unread, so UnreadRune succeeds and a second UnreadRune fails. With only 'é' initially present, ReadRune drains the buffer and an immediate UnreadRune still succeeds. Insert Grow(0) between those calls and the drained buffer resets, so UnreadRune fails.",
